  "method": "Complete episodes only. Select physics samples whose control reference frame/50 is in [0,1.25]s. Reshape wheel_center_position_w to [n,2,3], compute Euclidean norm of right-left world XY difference. Each episode reports mean,min,max and fraction outside saved band [0.496,0.536]m. Samples are post-physics +5..20ms; descriptive geometric statistic, not reward replay. feet_distance_penalize actually constrains wheel centers, not foot-link separation.",
